-- Seed only the 26 SAI NCOE centre entries listed in the Government of India's
-- Rajya Sabha Question 2394, answered 12 March 2026, Annexure II (2025–2026).
-- Primary source: https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/270/AU2394_VhjDk7.pdf?source=pqars
-- Official SAI directory: https://sportsauthorityofindia.gov.in/sai_new/sai-sports-centers
-- Centre names and disciplines follow the Government source. The source says Zirakpur's
-- discipline is "Yet to be Started"; SAI's scheme brief also says Zirakpur and Cooch Behar
-- are not operational. They are included as government-listed centres but are explicitly
-- not represented as operational or accepting athletes. No address/contact/trial availability
-- or public-booking availability is inferred.

